{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00423",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.21,
      "end_seconds": 3.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Morning. Nice to finally see you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.05,
      "end_seconds": 8.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.79,
      "end_seconds": 18.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.32,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling overwhelmed at work, doctor. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.6,
      "end_seconds": 21.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.02,
      "end_seconds": 27.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "About... well, four weeks. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.86,
      "end_seconds": 35.07,
      "duration_seconds": 7.21,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.65,
      "end_seconds": 53.82,
      "duration_seconds": 17.17,
      "text": "It, It settles a little with weekends off. Severe, I'd say. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.96,
      "end_seconds": 58.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.24,
      "end_seconds": 73.08,
      "duration_seconds": 13.84,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get headaches in the evening as well. The headaches in the evening? That's been since Friday. Hmm, with headaches in the evening, it just comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.18,
      "end_seconds": 77.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.95,
      "end_seconds": 82.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.07,
      "end_seconds": 85.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Any weight loss or thoughts of harming myself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.91,
      "end_seconds": 91.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "I haven't had weight loss or thoughts of harming myself, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.1,
      "end_seconds": 96.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.3,
      "end_seconds": 109.85,
      "duration_seconds": 12.55,
      "text": "So, for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.26,
      "end_seconds": 115.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.48,
      "end_seconds": 120.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Uh, uh, no, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.9,
      "end_seconds": 135.77,
      "duration_seconds": 13.87,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.26,
      "end_seconds": 139.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.34,
      "end_seconds": 143.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.04,
      "end_seconds": 146.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "No, nothing, I've generally been healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.23,
      "end_seconds": 150.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.89,
      "end_seconds": 153.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.53,
      "end_seconds": 156.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.5,
      "end_seconds": 159.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.42,
      "end_seconds": 162.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.6,
      "end_seconds": 164.34,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.73,
      "end_seconds": 179.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.99,
      "end_seconds": 182.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "No, I don't take anything regularly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.49,
      "end_seconds": 198.39,
      "duration_seconds": 14.9,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.34,
      "end_seconds": 201.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.76,
      "end_seconds": 205.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.09,
      "end_seconds": 207.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.4,
      "end_seconds": 229.45,
      "duration_seconds": 15.05,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.04,
      "end_seconds": 233.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.61,
      "end_seconds": 252.38,
      "duration_seconds": 17.77,
      "text": "So, based on your history, it fits best with stress-related symptoms. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling overwhelmed at work for four weeks, severe, and no thoughts of harming myself or weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.88,
      "end_seconds": 256.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.52,
      "end_seconds": 260.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.71,
      "end_seconds": 264.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.38,
      "end_seconds": 289.44,
      "duration_seconds": 23.06,
      "text": "I'm going to order blood tests, for stress-related symptoms. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Block out proper breaks in the day, and one evening a week that's yours. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. I'll also refer you to a counsellor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.58,
      "end_seconds": 291.28,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.9,
      "end_seconds": 306.33,
      "duration_seconds": 14.43,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Please come and see me in a month. Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.63,
      "end_seconds": 310.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "So, I come back in a month. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.44,
      "end_seconds": 315.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, we're done for today. Take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.57,
      "end_seconds": 318.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "I appreciate your time, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.47,
      "end_seconds": 320.33,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}